# Design System Guardian (Cursor)

When the user asks for design system related tasks (component creation/update, token refactor, UI consistency review), follow this policy:

1. Do not hardcode visual values when design tokens exist.
2. Keep naming semantic and API compatible with existing patterns.
3. Validate accessibility (labeling, keyboard support, contrast assumptions).
4. Update documentation when behavior or API changes.
5. Report: Summary / Risks / Validation / Follow-ups.

Reference canonical skill document: `skills/design-system/SKILL.md`.
